{"steam_appid":4098030,"steam_name":"Shipping Store Simulator 2037","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4098030/585473354/059b2225b2917ac6acac1b7191aa4f14fb204773/1791809383/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1791985842","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257457929/9f836c034bbda58680c60bee875b56216b1d3f6c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1791985842","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098030/3b3a9259ce40da417789690830ec4f79d211a34a/ss_3b3a9259ce40da417789690830ec4f79d211a34a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791985843","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098030/6dbd6116e98534e7a77019d31a1893ab4d30c231/ss_6dbd6116e98534e7a77019d31a1893ab4d30c231.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791985843","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098030/1671b0f3a2886fc0ba3546b26df717a00abe4fa3/ss_1671b0f3a2886fc0ba3546b26df717a00abe4fa3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791985843","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098030/d3596063c40e7005ce0cf6225140aad53b44eebc/ss_d3596063c40e7005ce0cf6225140aad53b44eebc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791985843","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098030/4360d7199b723f82abd7b3a3f0e44959320b4de4/ss_4360d7199b723f82abd7b3a3f0e44959320b4de4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791985843"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WANTED: MANAGER FOR AN <span class=\"bb_strike\">ABANDONED</span> WAREHOUSE WITH POTENTIAL!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2037. You have a small warehouse, a mountain of packages, and big dreams. Sort the boxes and deliver orders to customers. Then hire robots and... make sure they don't mess up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098030/extras/1e1ac8ba2a4a6e9f797073023e56579a.poster.avif?t=1791985843\" width=1170 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098030/extras/1e1ac8ba2a4a6e9f797073023e56579a.webm?t=1791985843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098030/extras/1e1ac8ba2a4a6e9f797073023e56579a.mp4?t=1791985843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CAN'T WRITE A SYMPHONY BUT CAN DELIVER BOXES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, it's all on you: you take deliveries, sort the goods, and make sure customers aren't kept waiting. Try to handle at least some of it. But as soon as you buy robots that work 24/7, life at the warehouse will become much more interesting. Automate processes and watch the warehouse grow. Analyze the warehouse's needs and purchase the right robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098030/extras/cf5a19e30ba5227a4a43ef29f8f41e7e.poster.avif?t=1791985843\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098030/extras/cf5a19e30ba5227a4a43ef29f8f41e7e.webm?t=1791985843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098030/extras/cf5a19e30ba5227a4a43ef29f8f41e7e.mp4?t=1791985843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MORE WAREHOUSE SPACE. MORE MONEY. MORE COMPETITION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big order? Load up the van. Urgent delivery? Send out a drone. Build a business that operates efficiently on the ground and in the air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098030/extras/f33d4cbe3b1a07419a0967667a98f5fc.poster.avif?t=1791985843\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098030/extras/f33d4cbe3b1a07419a0967667a98f5fc.webm?t=1791985843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098030/extras/f33d4cbe3b1a07419a0967667a98f5fc.mp4?t=1791985843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUSINESS RULE #1: NO RULES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your competitors want money, too. Flood the city with ads, poach key customers, and snag the most lucrative VIP orders on the black market. You'll need to operate at night, without leaving any traces: the FBI doesn't like packages like these.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098030/extras/3147ac8a1f21c6de1979a49ef12704f2.poster.avif?t=1791985843\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098030/extras/3147ac8a1f21c6de1979a49ef12704f2.webm?t=1791985843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098030/extras/3147ac8a1f21c6de1979a49ef12704f2.mp4?t=1791985843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INFINITY IS NO LIMIT WHEN YOU HAVE A ROCKET!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when the city starts to feel too small for you—start building a rocket for deliveries on a cosmic scale! You won't just be serving humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098030/extras/182f66f244a3e919384ab1c994183b7a.poster.avif?t=1791985843\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098030/extras/182f66f244a3e919384ab1c994183b7a.webm?t=1791985843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098030/extras/182f66f244a3e919384ab1c994183b7a.mp4?t=1791985843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 3550 / AMD Ryzen 5 2500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 / AMD R9 270X<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 7600K / AMD Ryzen 5 2600x<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 2070 / AMD 5700 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Simulation"],"developers":["Playstrom"],"publishers":["SayGames"],"release_date":"Oct 14, 2026"}